<title>GERMANY: Holzmann - Binder to replace Mayer as CEO.</title>
<headline>Holzmann - Binder to replace Mayer as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Philipp Holzmann  AG said on Friday that Heinrich Binder would replace Lothar Mayer  as management board chairman of the group on September 19.</p>
<p>Binder is currently management board chairman of the German car component  supplier Kolbenschmidt AG.</p>
<p>Mayer announced he was stepping down as management board chairman  at the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
